  "components": {
    "talent": [
      {
        "key": "靈覺 · 寒星",
        "title": "靈覺 · 寒星",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/07/01/84496276/1ce09211f025bf5470682189e0837732_184490976503350974.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd780>普通攻擊</color>\n造成1點 <color=#99ffff>冰元素傷害</color> 。"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": null
      },
      {
        "key": "千變的浮彩",
        "title": "千變的浮彩",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/07/01/84496276/cea7ba56cead2f40e0d86133a2009e8c_3370676549427071966.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd680>元素戰技</color>\n造成1點 <color=#99ffff>冰元素傷害</color> <color=#ece4d9>，</color> 將1張 <color=#ffffff>浮彩</color> 加入牌庫中第3張的位置，並從3個隨機的 <color=#ffffff>浮彩</color> 強化效果中 <color=#ffffff>挑選</color> 1個。"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "浮彩",
        "title": "浮彩",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/07/01/84496276/db13288db6b90ec33f8adc2656d2019f_3021526384949461714.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd680>事件牌</color>\n<color=#ffffff>戰鬥行動：</color> 生成2層 <color=#ffffff>護盾</color> 。"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "沍寒的圖繪",
        "title": "沍寒的圖繪",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/07/01/84496276/95bbe8a0cd13aede78f13a25ada3328b_7776727913148162839.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd680>元素爆發</color>\n造成4點 <color=#99ffff>冰元素傷害</color> ，將1張 <color=#ffffff>浮彩</color> 加入手牌。"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "斑斕的絢影",
        "title": "斑斕的絢影",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/07/01/84496276/9b02b889475c9a56f3eee6ee7ae7c984_3445114120977146536.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd680>被動技能</color>\n【被動】戰鬥開始時，生成3張 <color=#ffffff>浮彩</color> ，均匀放入牌庫。"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "冰元素傷害",
        "title": "冰元素傷害",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/07/01/84496276/4bcc4b82a9d7ee22770f60afa54e9919_8834646002893734779.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "附著冰元素，可發生元素反應：\n【 <color=#99ffff>冰元素</color> + <color=#ff9999>火元素</color> 】 <color=#ffffff>融化</color> ：本傷害+2\n【 <color=#99ffff>冰元素</color> + <color=#ffacff>雷元素</color> 】 <color=#ffffff>超導</color> ：本傷害+1，對目標以外的所有敵方角色造成1點穿透傷害\n【 <color=#99ffff>冰元素</color> + <color=#80c0ff>水元素</color> 】 <color=#ffffff>凍結</color> ：本傷害+1，使目標本回合無法行動（受到物理或火元素傷害後提前解除，但是傷害+2）"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "規則解釋",
        "title": "規則解釋",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/07/01/84496276/07bae546ac7c69ef6402170b283840c5_3601624118834066782.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffffff>挑選</color>\n從特定的多張牌中選擇1張執行效果。\n<color=#ffffff>戰鬥行動</color>\n我方執行了一次戰鬥行動後，會輪到對方行動。\n<color=#ffffff>打出具有此規則的手牌是一個戰鬥行動，而非快速行動。</color>\n<color=#ffffff>護盾</color>\n<color=#ffd680>出戰狀態</color>\n為我方出戰角色提供 <color=#ffffff>1點護盾</color> 。（可疊加）\n<color=#ffffff>護盾</color>\n此護盾所保護的角色受到傷害時，將會消耗護盾來抵消傷害。"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      }
    ],
